      },
      "text": "```\nDIGITAL WORKFLOW PIPELINE:"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-DIGITAL-WORKFLOW.md#004",
      "path": [
        "07-DIGITAL-WORKFLOW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:photography:07-digital-workflow, git-history:photography:07-digital-workflow]",
        "canonical_path": "photography/07-DIGITAL-WORKFLOW.md",
        "concepts": "[digital, workflow]",
        "current_path": "photography/07-DIGITAL-WORKFLOW.md",
        "id": "maxim:photography:digital-workflow",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "photography",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[digital, workflow]",
        "section": "photography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Digital Workflow",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "CAPTURE\n  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │ Sensor → Bayer CFA → ADC → Linear RAW data (12/14 bit)       │\n  │ White balance tag, exposure metadata written (not applied)   │\n  └────────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────┘\n                                   │ RAW file (.CR3, .NEF, .ARW, .DNG)\n  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │ RAW PROCESSING (Lightroom, Capture One, darktable, RawTherapee)│\n  │  1. White balance → chromatic adaptation → neutral grays     │\n  │  2. Demosaicing → full RGB at every pixel                    │\n  │  3. Tone curve → map linear scene values to perceptual space │\n  │  4. Color space conversion → sRGB / AdobeRGB / ProPhoto      │\n  │  5. Noise reduction → luminance NR + color NR                │\n  │  6. Output sharpening → USM or deconvolution                 │\n  └────────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────┘\n                                   │ Processed image (16-bit TIFF)\n  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │ EDITING (Photoshop, Affinity Photo, Pixelmator)              │\n  │  Local adjustments, compositing, retouching                  │\n  └────────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────┘\n                                   │\n  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │ OUTPUT                                                       │\n  │  Screen: sRGB JPEG/HEIC (8-bit; ICC embed)                   │\n  │  Print: CMYK conversion; soft proof → printer profile TIFF   │\n  │  Archive: original RAW + sidecar (.xmp) or catalog backup    │\n  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
    },
    {
