        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Digital Workflow",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nRAW FILE CONTENTS:\n  Unprocessed (or minimally processed) sensor data:\n  → Bayer CFA values: one color channel per pixel, linear luminance\n  → Typically 12 or 14-bit integer values (4096 or 16384 levels)\n  → Metadata: camera model, lens, shutter speed, aperture, ISO, GPS\n  → White balance setting (recorded but NOT baked in — can be changed)\n  → JPEG preview (embedded; used by card readers/OS, not actual image data)\n  → Color matrix: transforms sensor's native primaries to camera color space\n  → Tone curve: recorded (if applied to JPEG preview) but raw data is always linear"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-DIGITAL-WORKFLOW.md#010",
      "path": [
        "07-DIGITAL-WORKFLOW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:photography:07-digital-workflow, git-history:photography:07-digital-workflow]",
        "canonical_path": "photography/07-DIGITAL-WORKFLOW.md",
        "concepts": "[digital, workflow]",
        "current_path": "photography/07-DIGITAL-WORKFLOW.md",
        "id": "maxim:photography:digital-workflow",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "photography",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[digital, workflow]",
        "section": "photography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Digital Workflow",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "WHAT IT IS NOT:\n  Not \"unprocessed\" — it IS processed:\n    Demosaicing not yet done\n    But: dark current subtraction, defective pixel correction, sometimes lens correction\n    \"Raw\" = sensor CFA values with minimal processing, not zero processing"
    },
