      "text": "PROPRIETARY vs DNG:\n  Proprietary formats: .CR3 (Canon), .NEF (Nikon), .ARW (Sony), .RAF (Fuji), .ORF (Olympus)\n  → Manufacturers can change format; old software may break\n  → Undocumented internal structures in some"
